{"id":8,"name":"EV008","note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":47,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"characterIndex":0,"characterName":"","direction":2,"pattern":0,"tileId":0},"list":[{"code":111,"indent":0,"parameters":[0,36,0]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[6](This is Maiko's diary... Usually I'd feel bad about looking through"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["someone's personal possessions, but it's for the greater good isn't it?)"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[6](...Asuga better thank me after this.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('I know it sounds terrible of me to say, but I genuinely felt "]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["really happy seeing Yui as my hostage. It proves that she's been "]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["thinking about me too. That it's not just me. We really are best"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["friends until the end! ^^ I just hope she'll be okay...')"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('I've just been trying not to think too hard about it, I found"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["some 'Orange' CDs in the bottom of my closet so I've been watching "]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["those. >:3c')"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('But sometimes I think this room was made to torture me with"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["how they only gave me BAD anime to watch!! The relationship in it"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["makes me really uncomfortable!! But the kissing scenes made me "]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["giddy so maybe I'm just a freak...TvT')"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[6](...I'm just going to skip over the paragraph where she describes"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["these anime makeout scenes in explicit detail. For my own sake.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('Anyway! I can't wait to see Yui again when I get out, it's"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["sort of scary not being able to keep up with what she's doing...')"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('I wanna go get cake with her againnn...!!!! TwT')"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('She'd get her soft delicate strawberry shortcake like usual"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["and have two or three bites, she has so much control!! O.O')"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('I just can't help myself when chocolate is involved, the"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["chocolate ganache they put on top is so yum.com! But it's *way* "]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["less sweet in Japan than it is back home T3T')"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('Maybe we could combine them and make chocolate-covered"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["strawberries! Yui probably would think it was silly... But it's"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["so Valentinesy, isn't it?')"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\c[27]('I wonder if we'll be stuck here until Valentines... What"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["if we're the last humans left alive and we have to repopulate the "]},{"code":401,"in